d from BESSY measurements with a prototype eROSITA   COMMENT CCD with a 200 nm Al on-chip filter, at a fixed low energy threshold    COMMENT of ~50 eV, using two pixel events. The actual eROSITA RMF is likely     COMMENT to have somewhat less energy resolution.                                COMMENT *** Note: this RMF is not normalized to 1, but to the energy ***        COMMENT *** dependent fraction of two pixel events. ***                         COMMENT ----------------------------------------------------------------------  END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             =ÃÃÕ=ÿå¢␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ ␀␀␀=ÿå¢=‰‡␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Ñ␀␀␀␀␀␀Ü␀␀␀!␀␀␀à=‰‡=Ò«&␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀␀=Ò«&=ˇ<à␀␀␀␀␀␀î␀␀␀␀␀ñ␀␀␀"␀␀ò=ˇ<à>üâ␀␀␀␀␀␀ ␀␀␀␀␀"␀␀␀#␀␀$>üâ>„%␀␀␀␀␀␀∞␀␀␀␀␀≤␀␀␀$␀␀¥>„%>e:␀␀␀␀␀␀D␀␀␀␀␀F␀␀␀%␀␀H>e:>ˇ␀␀␀␀␀␀‹␀␀␀␀␀ﬁ␀␀␀